  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support Victims of Earthquake in Afghanistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Between June 21-22, 2022 a devastating 5.9 magnitude earthquake occurred in the region of Paktika and Khost Provinces, eastern Afghanistan bordering Pakistan.   According to a report released by the OCHA on June 23, approximately 770 people were estimated to have been killed. The number of deaths continues to rise and is currently estimated to be nearly 1,150.</narrative>
  </description>
